                                "sense_id": "dde82b6d-d76f-3ba7-b956-b206f528fd21",
                                "text": "At times, the assimilationist paradigm has facilitated the physical dispossession of Native lands and the suppression or eradication of Native institutions, culture, and identity by the political branches of the federal government."
