                                "example_id": "5c89f2c4-694c-4d09-8dfc-596199ebddcd",
                                "sense_id": "5f18caa1-e6a1-3c70-ada1-83dbb0817eac",
                                "text": "There had been a series of such dispossessions since the beginning of Elizabeth's reign involving many clergy, particularly those of vehement Protestant sympathies."
